# Closed-source commercial capabilities must live in a separate private repo.
# These ignores are a last-resort git safety net; release builds also fail when
# any of these paths exist inside the public source tree or final artifact.
private/
enterprise/
commercial_private/
commercial-private/
.entitlements/
*.license

